te $z=\\frac{2y-x}{{x}^{3}-{y}^{2}-4}$ at the point $(2,-2).$" :question/worked-solution "To evaluate our multivariable function at the point $(2,-2),$ we substitute $x=2$ and $y=-2$ into the function expression:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}z\\,{|}_{(2,-2)} & =\\frac{2y-x}{{x}^{3}-{y}^{2}-4}\\,{|}_{(2,-2)} \\\\  & =\\frac{2(-2)-2}{{2}^{3}-(-2)^{2}-4} \\\\  & =\\frac{-4-2}{8-4-4} \\\\  & =\\frac{(-6)}{0},\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich is undefined." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-378dd559-16b2-53c2-b64a-808e9c526e35"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-378dd559-16b2-53c2-b64a-808e9c526e35" :answer-field/id #uuid "378dd559-16b2-53c2-b64a-808e9c526e35" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-c11088d1-89b4-5f2e-9c65-45b33b86af64" :answer-field/choices ["answer-4332d078-c596-5ab9-a9fd-b2600b41dcb1" "answer-f1a761eb-6b14-555e-ba52-76a27a6e6871" "answer-529e6e4c-543b-5b5d-91ba-42883dfabf92" "answer-ade04a22-b4eb-505b-8eb9-82420c1e8561" "answer-c11088d1-89b4-5f2e-9c65-45b33b86af64"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-4332d078-c596-5ab9-a9fd-b2600b41dcb1" :answer/id #uuid "4332d078-c596-5ab9-a9fd-b2600b41dcb1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f1a761eb-6b14-555e-ba52-76a27a6e6871" :answer/id #uuid "f1a761eb-6b14-555e-ba52-76a27a6e6871" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{3}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-529e6e4c-543b-5b5d-91ba-42883dfabf92" :answer/id #uuid "529e6e4c-543b-5b5d-91ba-42883dfabf92" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ade04a22-b4eb-505b-8eb9-82420c1e8561" :answer/id #uuid "ade04a22-b4eb-505b-8eb9-82420c1e8561" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{6}{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c11088d1-89b4-5f2e-9c65-45b33b86af64" :answer/id #uuid "c11088d1-89b4-5f2e-9c65-45b33b86af64" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "Undefined" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-9c34765f-7311-53ab-be9b-191b42487450" :question/id #uuid "9c34765f-7311-53ab-be9b-191b42487450" :question/math-academy-id "q-158585" :question/problem "Evaluate $z={2}^{-x}+\\frac{1}{y}$ at the point $(2,2).$" :question/worked-solution "To evaluate our multivariable function at the point $(2,2),$ we substitute $x=2$ and $y=2$ into the function expression:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}z\\,{|}_{(2,2)} & =({2}^{-x}+\\frac{1}{y}){|}_{(2,2)} \\\\  & ={2}^{-2}+\\frac{1}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{{2}^{2}}+\\frac{1}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}+\\frac{1}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-893376bc-f857-5c82-9b7f-472d1ddbccda"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-893376bc-f857-5c82-9b7f-472d1ddbccda" :answer-field/id #uuid "893376bc-f857-5c82-9b7f-472d1ddbccda" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-a69cfe99-5dda-5c7f-a8ae-e9e88f862d43" :answer-field/choices ["answer-dbef1e38-02bf-5cd7-beba-116a24ac4bd4" "answer-8ca77a3e-9085-58ef-87e4-a39c3ee58fbe" "answer-c4a63f4b-3cca-51c6-b369-5d4f828546a4" "answer-a69cfe99-5dda-5c7f-a8ae-e9e88f862d43" "answer-e866b3d9-12d2-51c5-a482-af43a7c89490"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-dbef1e38-02bf-5cd7-beba-116a24ac4bd4" :answer/id #uuid "dbef1e38-02bf-5cd7-beba-116a24ac4bd4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8ca77a3e-9085-58ef-87e4-a39c3ee58fbe" :answer/id #uuid "8ca77a3e-9085-58ef-87e4-a39c3ee58fbe" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c4a63f4b-3cca-51c6-b369-5d4f828546a4" :answer/id #uuid "c4a63f4b-3cca-51c6-b369-5d4f828546a4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a69cfe99-5dda-5c7f-a8ae-e9e88f862d43" :answer/id #uuid "a69cfe99-5dda-5c7f-a8ae-e9e88f862d43" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e866b3d9-12d2-51c5-a482-af43a7c89490" :answer/id #uuid "e866b3d9-12d2-51c5-a482-af43a7c89490" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{5}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186124804 :question/problem "Evaluate $z={x}^{2}+xy-5$ at the point $(1,2).$" :question/worked-solution "To evaluate our multivariable function at the point $(1,2),$ we substitute $x=1$ and $y=2$ into the function expression:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}z\\,{|}_{(1,2)} & =({x}^{2}+xy-5)\\,{|}_{(1,2)} \\\\  & =(1)^{2}+(1)(2)-5 \\\\  & =-2\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186121421 :answer-field/correct 17592186121426 :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "question-be7cd3c6-b4d8-58fc-a0bb-f9185ad55778" :question/id #uuid "be7cd3c6-b4d8-58fc-a0bb-f9185ad55778" :question/math-academy-id "q-158568" :question/problem "The function $f(x,y)$ is defined as \n\n$$\nf(x,y)=x\\operatorname{arccos}⁡(y+1).\n$$\n\nEvaluate this function at the point $(-3,1).$" :question/worked-solution "To evaluate our multivariable function at the point $(-3,1),$ we substitute $x=-3$ and $y=1$ into the function expression:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(-3,1) & =x\\operatorname{arccos}⁡(y+1)\\,{|}_{(-3,1)} \\\\  & =-3\\operatorname{arccos}⁡(1+1) \\\\  & =-3\\operatorname{arccos}⁡2,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich is undefined." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-10d9af3a-10f7-5e92-bc23-9dd627657054"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-10d9af3a-10f7-5e92-bc23-9dd627657054" :answer-field/id #uuid "10d9af3a-10f7-5e92-bc23-9dd627657054" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.typ