1824679-625d-5463-b2f3-fb72a493af82" :question/math-academy-id "q-158554"] ["question-a1824679-625d-5463-b2f3-fb72a493af82" :question/problem "Find the domain of the function $f(x,y)=\\frac{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}{{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}}.$"] ["question-a1824679-625d-5463-b2f3-fb72a493af82" :question/worked-solution "The function is well-defined at all points $(x,y)$ for which the following condition is satisfied:\n\n- The expression in the denominator is not equal to zero.\n\nAs a result, the points in the domain must satisfy the following inequality:\n\n$$\n{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}\\ne 0\n$$\n\nTherefore, the domain is\n\n$$\n\\{(x,y)\\in {R}^{2}\\,:\\,{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}\\ne 0\\}.\n$$"] ["question-a1824679-625d-5463-b2f3-fb72a493af82" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-d0effc05-87d0-589c-bbda-8eebc905e53e" :answer-field/id #uuid "d0effc05-87d0-589c-bbda-8eebc905e53e"] ["answer-0f719873-855b-510a-a974-761504b7537d" :answer/id #uuid "0f719873-855b-510a-a974-761504b7537d"] ["answer-0f719873-855b-510a-a974-761504b7537d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-0f719873-855b-510a-a974-761504b7537d" :answer/value "\\{(x,y)\\in {R}^{2}\\,:\\,{x}^{2}+y\\ne 0\\}"] ["answer-0acdc5a5-82d8-5e8c-8ed0-61de70bd1223" :answer/id #uuid "0acdc5a5-82d8-5e8c-8ed0-61de70bd1223"] ["answer-0acdc5a5-82d8-5e8c-8ed0-61de70bd1223" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-0acdc5a5-82d8-5e8c-8ed0-61de70bd1223" :answer/value "\\{(x,y)\\in {R}^{2}\\,:\\,{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}=0\\}"] ["answer-3cd2fadc-384e-56c3-ae50-0d963c2dd45a" :answer/id #uuid "3cd2fadc-384e-56c3-ae50-0d963c2dd45a"] ["answer-3cd2fadc-384e-56c3-ae50-0d963c2dd45a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-3cd2fadc-384e-56c3-ae50-0d963c2dd45a" :answer/value "\\{(x,y)\\in {R}^{2}\\,:\\,{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}\\ne 0\\}"] ["answer-afcfd169-0a6a-5b23-9542-bc1a80e450be" :answer/id #uuid "afcfd169-0a6a-5b23-9542-bc1a80e450be"] ["answer-afcfd169-0a6a-5b23-9542-bc1a80e450be" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-afcfd169-0a6a-5b23-9542-bc1a80e450be"